<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admission Letter - <%= firstName %> <%= lastName %></title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            width: 20%;
        }

        .underline-cell {
            border-bottom: 1px solid black;
            width: 80%;
        }

        .page-break {
            border-top: 3px double #000;
            margin: 40px 0;
            padding-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            page-break-after: always;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h3>MINISTRY OF EDUCATION</h3>
    <h1>RIATIRIMBA TECHNICAL AND VOCATIONAL COLLEGE</h1>
    <p>P.O. BOX 25-40201 GESUSU | Mobile: 0757331085<br>
        Email: info@riatirimbatvc.ac.ke | Website: www.riatirimbatvc.ac.ke</p>
</header>

<div class="section">
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>FULL NAME</th>
            <td class="underline-cell"><%= name %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>ADM.NO</th>
            <td class="underline-cell"><%= admissionNumber %></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <h2>RE: OFFER OF ADMISSION AND JOINING INSTRUCTIONS</h2>
    <p>Following your application for admission to Riatirimba Technical and Vocational College (RTVC), we are pleased to
        inform you that your application was successful. You have been offered a chance to pursue studies in <strong><%= course %></strong> under the
        <strong><%= department %></strong></p>

    <p>
        <strong>Registration:</strong> From 01/09/2025 (9:00am - 5:00pm).<br>
        <strong>Lectures:</strong> Begin 02/09/2025.<br>
        <strong>Deadline:</strong> Those not reporting by 05/09/2025 will be assumed to have no further interest and
        forfeit the chance.
    </p>

    <h3>Payment of Fees</h3>
    <p>All fees for the academic year must be deposited to the college account. No cash is accepted in the college.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Bank Name:</strong> KENYA COMMERCIAL BANK (KCB)</li>
        <li><strong>Branch:</strong> KEROKA</li>
        <li><strong>Account Name:</strong> RIATIRIMBA TECHNICAL AND VOCATIONAL COLLEGE</li>
        <li><strong>Account No:</strong> 1283392763</li>
    </ul>

    <p><em>Yours sincerely,</em><br>
        <strong>KAWALA J.O</strong><br>
        PRINCIPAL/BOG SECRETARY
    </p>
</div>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>JOINING INSTRUCTIONS & MEDICAL FORM</h2>
    <p><strong>Stationery:</strong> Students must bring ruled papers, A4 exercise books, files, pens, and a scientific
        calculator.</p>
    <p><strong>Health:</strong> A medical examination must be completed by a certified healthcare professional
        (Government Doctor or Registered Practitioner). The college provides only basic first aid; trainees are
        responsible for external medical expenses and are encouraged to utilize SHIF coverage.</p>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>REQUIREMENTS FOR ADMISSION</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Copies & Originals of:
            <ol>
                <li>Birth Certificate</li>
                <li>National ID</li>
                <li>Leaving Certificates (Primary & Secondary)</li>
                <li>KCPE Result Slip</li>
                <li>KCSE Certificate/Result Slip</li>
            </ol>
        </li>
        <li>Two (2) Colored Passport Size Photos</li>
        <li>One (1) Ream of printing papers and 4 Spring Files</li>

        <% if (isEngineering) { %>
            <li><strong>Engineering Specific Requirements:</strong>
                <ol>
                    <li>Navy-blue dust coat or overall</li>
                    <li>Safety boots</li>
                    <li>Technical drawing set & T-square</li>
                    <li>Scientific calculator (e.g., fx82ms, fx570ES PLUS)</li>
                </ol>
            </li>
        <% } %>
    </ul>
</div>

</body>
</html>